# Root-level scratch policy: experiment outputs and one-off scripts at the
# repo root are never tracked. The canonical CLI lives in src/png2svg_gs/cli.py
# (and the `png2svg` launcher, whitelisted below); durable scripts belong in
# scripts/ or tools/, durable outputs in docs/.
/*.py
/*.html
/*.json
/*.png
/*.js

# Whitelisted root files
!/png2svg
!/pyproject.toml

# Note: /*.svg is already covered by the global *.svg rule above.

# PowerPoint owner-lock files, created whenever a deck is opened.
~$*

# Measured experiment outputs. The curated result set is tracked; the two
# heavy regenerable artifacts are not (see result/README.md).
/result/artifacts/chameleon.svg
/result/artifacts/powerpoint_screen_capture.png

# Reference corpus: images regenerate from skimage.data via
# `python tools/corpus_benchmark.py --materialize`; runs are large.
# corpus.json (the manifest with hashes) and results.jsonl ARE tracked.
/result/corpus/images/
/result/corpus/runs/
